                            en:'📌 <strong>About store information:</strong> For privacy of hearing partners, stores are anonymized as <strong>Store A, B…</strong> and names as <strong>Mr./Ms. A, B…</strong>.<br>If a partner wishes to be listed with real name, we publish after individual discussion and consent.',
                            zh:'📌 <strong>关于店铺信息标记:</strong> 为保护调研协力店铺隐私,店铺名匿名为 <strong>A 店·B 店…</strong>,姓名为 <strong>A 様·B 様…</strong>。<br>希望真实店铺名·实名刊登的客户,经个别商谈和同意后刊登。',
