                    en:'<strong>🔒 Privacy & Safety</strong><br>・<strong>Staff taps are anonymous aggregation only</strong> — individual ratings hidden even from the manager<br>・Manager\'s "concerning person" taps are <strong>visible only to the manager</strong>; staff are not notified<br>・AI suggestions are <strong>always "ask first"</strong> — no auto shift changes or blocks<br>・Data auto-deleted after 90 days — no dragging old tensions',
