                       en:'① All staff take the <strong>12-question test</strong> on their phones (~1 min)<br>② MBTI type shows on staff info in the Shift Manager<br>③ When making shifts, <strong>incompatible pairs</strong> in the same slot trigger an AI warning ⚠️<br>④ Manager checks warning, adjusts shifts → prevents workplace conflicts<br><br>※ Available on <strong>Free plan</strong>. Inspired by official MBTI insights with our own question set.',
